5. Validate the returned object shape:
   - Has `id`, `email`, `name` keys
   - Has `posts` array with 2 items, each having `title`
6. Write validation result to `/home/user/myproject/payload_result.json`:
   `{ "shapeValid": true, "postCount": 2 }`

